 "harakat_level": "ambiguous_only",
 "hook_uz": "B1 ga xush kelibsiz! A2 da majhulning o'tgan zamonini ko'rgandik (كُتِبَ — yozildi). Endi TO'LIQ tizim: hozirgi zamon majhuli (يُكْتَبُ — yoziladi), bajaruvchini aytish (مِنْ قِبَلِ — tomonidan) va illatli fe'llar majhuli (قِيلَ — deyildi). Yangiliklar tili aynan shu shaklda gapiradi!",
 "grammar": {
  "point_ar": "فُعِلَ / يُفْعَلُ",
  "explanation_uz": "MAJHUL YASASH: (1) O'tgan zamon: 1-harf DAMMA + o'rtadan oldingi harf KASRA — كَتَبَ→كُتِبَ, فَتَحَ→فُتِحَ. (2) Hozirgi zamon: muzori' prefiksi DAMMA + o'rtadan oldingi harf FATHA — يَكْتُبُ→يُكْتَبُ, يَفْتَحُ→يُفْتَحُ. (3) Bajaruvchi kerak bo'lsa: مِنْ قِبَلِ + ega («tomonidan»). (4) Illatlilar: قَالَ→قِيلَ (deyildi), بَاعَ→بِيعَ (sotildi). Majhulda ASL OB'EKT ega (noibul-foil) bo'lib, raf' holatga o'tadi.",
  "table": [
   {"ar": "كُتِبَ الدَّرْسُ", "uz": "dars yozildi (o'tgan majhul)", "form": "فُعِلَ"},
   {"ar": "يُكْتَبُ الدَّرْسُ", "uz": "dars yoziladi (hozirgi majhul)", "form": "يُفْعَلُ"},
   {"ar": "بُنِيَ المَسْجِدُ مِنْ قِبَلِ المُهَنْدِسِ", "uz": "masjid muhandis tomonidan qurildi", "form": "من قِبَل"},
   {"ar": "قِيلَ / بِيعَ", "uz": "deyildi / sotildi (ajvaf majhuli)", "form": "illatli"}
  ],
  "common_mistakes_uz": [
   "Hozirgi majhulda o'rta harakatni kasra qilish — يُكْتَبُ (fatha!), يُكْتِبُ emas.",
   "Majhuldan keyin ob'ektni nasbda qoldirish — u endi EGA: كُتِبَ الدرسُ (الدرسَ emas).",
   "قِيلَ ni قُوِلَ deb yasash — ajvafda o'rta illat kasra bilan ي ga aylanadi."
  ]
 },
